{"asset_key":"ep2/env_story_12303610","episode":"ep2","category":"env_story","story_id":"12303610","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1230361001:1":{"text":"Not at all.","source_cn":"不不不，怎么会。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6848D217CF883929","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1230361002:1":{"text":"Well... my weapon exists solely to slay the enemies. If there are none left, I'll feel like I'm without any sense of purpose.","source_cn":"只是……我手中的武器就是为了收割敌人的鲜血而存在的，如...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x61B5A3D154679E20","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1230361003:1":{"text":"As you know, my goal as a Carmine Whisper is to rid the town of all Water Wights. I train day and night to achieve this.","source_cn":"你也知道，作为血薇帮的人，水鬼彻底消失，就是我为此日夜...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7BF3442580581E96","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1230361004:1":{"text":"But I think there are even trickier issues looming ahead after the Water Wights are gone.","source_cn":"但水鬼消失后，应该有更棘手的问题在等我们解决吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4FC2802F87946431","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1230361005:1":{"text":"Don't worry, I'll pull myself together.","source_cn":"放心，我会振作起来的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3E3213C5B4E6D0E9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:血薇帮西斯":{"text":"Heath","source":"血薇帮西斯","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":6,"localized_text_count":5,"speaker_count":1}}